--TEST--
an `echo` whose expression is missing is reported at the empty span where it should have been, which is inside the statement and inside nothing else, so a whole-document answer names the statement itself, `rule:ide/one-grammar-one-tree`
--FILE--
<?nvs
echo;
--REQUEST--
diagnostics
--EXPECT--
